msgid ""
"This course is made up of several lessons. Each lesson has several check-in "
"questions throughout the text, so you can practice new skills or check your "
"understanding as you go. These are not required.\n"
msgstr ""
"คอร์สนี้ประกอบด้วยบทเรียนหลายบท "
"แต่ละบทเรียนมีคำถามตรวจสอบความเข้าใจตลอดเนื้อหา "
